{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.78] (DY Krazy)\n[00:02.14] DY Krazy (No Limit 150 dream team, nigga, shout out Maneski, shout out Bibby, shout out Herbo, shout out G-Money)\n[00:13.44] Man, change that shit DY Brazy, nigga (Pull them straps out?)\n[00:15.26] Like yeah, yeah, yeah (No Limit in the building, pull them racks out)\n[00:17.06] 150 in this bitch\n[00:17.44] Huh (Slatt talk)\n[00:17.84] Bitch, ya dig?\n[Chorus]\n[00:18.92] Huh, hm\n[00:19.14] Pull them racks out (Pull them motherfucking racks out, bitch)\n[00:23.44] Pull them straps out, huh, grrah (Nigga, pull them straps out, bitch), yeah\n[00:26.00] You the man now? Huh, yeah (You the motherfucking man now), chyeah\n[00:27.36] You the man now? (Nigga, you the man now), yeah, huh\n[00:28.46] Pull them racks out (Pull them racks—), huh, chyeah\n[00:29.56] Pull them straps out, yeah (Nigga, pull them straps out), hm, uh\n[00:32.04] You the man now? Huh, yeah (Nigga, you the man now), huh, huh, chyeah\n[00:35.08] I'm the man now, huh, yeah (Nigga, I'm the man)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:36.46] Skate in that bitch, Wayne Gretzky (Skate, skate)\n[00:38.26] Get her wetter than a fish on a jet-ski (Like a lake)\n[00:41.28] Squeezo brought Beretta in this bitch, don't try me (God damn)\n[00:43.94] Blood on confetti in this bitch, gun party (Bang-bang)\n[00:47.36] Opps come around (Uh)\n[00:48.96] We gun 'em down (Grrah)\n[00:50.42] It's No Limit gang (Yeah)\n[00:51.88] We the best around (Gang)\n[00:53.34] Fuck the rest around (Chain)\n[00:54.68] Choppa buck the rest around (Ayy)\n[00:56.08] AR with a titty round (Yeah, ayy)\n[00:57.42] Make 'em shut the city down (Ayy, ayy)\n[00:58.88] Red beam for Max, put it on a Smith and make it growl (Uh-huh)\n[01:02.00] Everywhere we go, it's mandatory that there's guns around (Uh-huh)\n[01:04.58] Touring coast to coast, headin' city to city, surfin' crowds (Uh-huh)\n[01:07.96] Only do a show if there's hundred K funds around (Uh-huh)\n[01:10.70] Take you to the car lot, uh, new Range Rover (Skrrt)\n[01:13.72] Take you to the real estate (Yeah), new crib, the gang over (That's the gang)\n[01:16.76] It's the same gang-gang, no, I will not change, oh (Yeah, that's the gang)\n[01:19.68] Bringing pain, switching lanes 'til the game, game over (Let's go), huh, uh\n[Chorus]\n[01:23.34] Huh, hm\n[01:23.52] Pull them racks out (Pull them racks out, racks out)\n[01:26.46] Pull them straps out, huh, grrah (Pull them straps out), yeah\n[01:29.44] You the man now? Huh, yeah (You the man now), chyeah\n[01:35.92] You the man now? (Nigga, you the man now), yeah, huh\n[01:37.02] Pull them racks out (Nigga, pull them racks out), chyeah\n[01:38.38] Pull them straps out, yeah (Nigga, pull them straps out), hm, uh\n[01:40.46] You the man now? Huh, yeah (Nigga, you the man now), huh, huh, chyeah\n[01:44.18] I'm the man now, huh, yeah (Nigga, I'm the man)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:47.42] I got what I got 'cause I worked for it, huh? (Huh)\n[01:49.78] I don't gotta answer to nobody, what? (Huh)\n[01:52.62] \"Better have some manners, I'm somebody\" Huh?\n[01:55.24] If you niggas couldn't tell, I do not give a fuck\n[01:58.18] If you ain't tryna wish me well, you can go to hell (Uh-huh)\n[02:00.70] Talkin' to niggas and talkin' to bitches too, hoes be Jezebel (Uh-huh)\n[02:04.12] I done did this by myself, I don't need no help (Uh-huh)\n[02:06.76] Tell everybody that had they back turned, I ain't need you there, uh\n[02:10.30] Say you wanna kill me, nigga, I ain't scared, uh (Nigga come on, come on)\n[02:13.22] To be honest, if I die, niggas won't care, uh (They be phony)\n[02:15.80] They fake love you when you alive and when you dead, uh (These motherfuckers be fake)\n[02:18.84] Sometimes I think, \"One day I'll wake up and there'll be no one there at all\" ('Cause all these niggas phony)\n[Chorus]\n[02:23.90] Huh, hm\n[02:24.10] Pull them racks out (Pull them racks out, racks out)\n[02:26.48] Pull them straps out, grrah (Pull them straps out), yeah\n[02:32.88] You the man now? Huh, yeah (You the man now), chyeah\n[02:35.46] You the man now? (Nigga, you the man now), yeah, huh\n[02:37.14] Pull them racks out (Nigga, pull them racks out, for real), chyeah\n[02:39.20] Pull them straps out, yeah (Nigga, pull them straps out), hm, uh\n[03:00.50] You the man now? Huh, yeah (Nigga, you the man now), huh, huh, chyeah\n[03:01.86] I'm the man now, huh, yeah (Nigga, I'm the man, oh)","words":[[0.06,1.18,"[Intro]"],[1.78,1.82,"(DY"],[1.96,2.1,"Krazy)"],[2.14,2.16,"DY"],[2.22,2.58,"Krazy"],[2.64,3.34,"(No"],[3.4,4.78,"Limit"],[4.8,6.62,"150"],[7.34,7.44,"dream"],[8.4,8.5,"team,"],[8.54,8.86,"nigga,"],[9.72,9.8,"shout"],[9.84,9.88,"out"],[9.94,10.16,"Maneski,"],[10.22,10.32,"shout"],[10.36,10.42,"out"],[10.46,10.6,"Bibby,"],[10.64,12.2,"shout"],[12.24,12.28,"out"],[12.52,12.76,"Herbo,"],[12.82,13.02,"shout"],[13.08,13.16,"out"],[13.2,13.4,"G-Money)"],[13.44,13.52,"Man,"],[13.56,14.02,"change"],[14.12,14.2,"that"],[14.24,14.3,"shit"],[14.34,14.36,"DY"],[14.4,14.48,"Brazy,"],[14.52,14.62,"nigga"],[14.66,14.78,"(Pull"],[14.82,14.88,"them"],[14.98,15.14,"straps"],[15.18,15.22,"out?)"],[15.26,15.32,"Like"],[15.36,15.42,"yeah,"],[15.46,15.54,"yeah,"],[15.58,15.64,"yeah"],[15.7,15.72,"(No"],[15.78,15.92,"Limit"],[15.96,16.02,"in"],[16.16,16.2,"the"],[16.24,16.38,"building,"],[16.42,16.5,"pull"],[16.54,16.66,"them"],[16.7,16.94,"racks"],[16.98,17.04,"out)"],[17.06,17.08,"150"],[17.12,17.16,"in"],[17.2,17.28,"this"],[17.32,17.4,"bitch"],[17.44,17.48,"Huh"],[17.52,17.62,"(Slatt"],[17.66,17.8,"talk)"],[17.84,17.94,"Bitch,"],[17.98,18.0,"ya"],[18.38,18.72,"dig?"],[18.76,18.88,"[Chorus]"],[18.92,18.98,"Huh,"],[19.08,19.1,"hm"],[19.14,19.24,"Pull"],[19.28,19.34,"them"],[19.38,19.48,"racks"],[19.54,19.62,"out"],[19.66,19.78,"(Pull"],[20.22,20.28,"them"],[20.32,20.6,"motherfucking"],[20.64,21.5,"racks"],[21.58,21.84,"out,"],[22.06,23.18,"bitch)"],[23.44,24.06,"Pull"],[24.16,24.34,"them"],[24.38,24.52,"straps"],[24.56,24.6,"out,"],[24.64,24.7,"huh,"],[24.74,24.86,"grrah"